WEBVTT

00:11:27.375 --> 00:11:30.851
so you or I don't need to get
our identity verified

00:11:30.875 --> 00:11:32.226
separately each time.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.726
There is a statistic in the world
that 40 percent of the dollars

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.768
that governments want to spend
to reach their citizenry

00:11:38.792 --> 00:11:40.518
for social benefit programs

00:11:40.542 --> 00:11:42.018
never reach them.

00:11:42.042 --> 00:11:43.393
They are called leakage.

00:11:43.417 --> 00:11:45.643
Leakage means administrative costs

00:11:45.667 --> 00:11:47.559
and I call it theft.

00:11:47.583 --> 00:11:49.518
Because it's 40 less cents on a dollar

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:52.518
for the person who cannot afford
even one cent less.

00:11:52.542 --> 00:11:53.809
That's the issue.

00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:55.726
That's what we're trying to solve for.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.809
Take out middlemen,
use technology to help,

00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:01.351
enable a direct government
to citizenry operation,